    "body": "It seems you're misreading the WebKit implementation. The element is only used there to decide between the old way of parsing and the new way. And the old way is a disabled code path in Apple ports of WebKit.\n\nIt also doesn't seem like CSS states that `currentcolor` would have to fail to parse. Merely that it has to have its initial value, which I think is the case in WebKit.",
